```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "list the bags holding one tiddler and the primary among them"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///engine.record.locates", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.record.locates"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.record.locates"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.record.locates ~ recipe presence: which bags hold a title

`lares wiki which <tiddler-uri>` asks the daemon's where verb which bags hold the tiddler and which one stands primary. A title no bag holds exits 5. Needs a standing vessel.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ which

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`which` params=`tiddler-uri/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance ~ the bags holding a title`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ tiddler-uri

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`tiddler-uri` params=`takes/title needs/required seat/1 as/<tiddler-uri> ~ the tiddler's title`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ vessel

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`vessel` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the daemon verb runs under the vessel's own did; this handler checks no ocap of its own`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · daemon-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[engine.record.locates tiddler-uri/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance]] ~ name the tiddler`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`daemon-refused` params=`~ the daemon's where verb refused; its message rides the line, exit 4`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ found · absent

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`found` params=`exit/0 fields/[[bags primaryBag]] ~ the bags and the primary`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`absent` params=`exit/5 ~ no bag holds the title`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares wiki which

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares wiki which]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

